@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Workshop Item Installation
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Workshop Item Selection" as Select
rectangle "Dependency Resolution" as Deps
rectangle "Byte Download" as Download
rectangle "Vapor Fingerprint Verification" as Verify
rectangle "Packagepack Enablement" as Enable
rectangle "Broken Install Rejection" as Reject

Select --> Deps : provides item metadata for
Deps --> Download : selects required items for
Download --> Verify : supplies local bytes to
Verify --> Enable : admits fingerprint match to
Verify --> Reject : routes fingerprint failure to
@enduml
